# moon lily
# a bulb
# left by the builder of bulb, 30 September 2026
# It keeps a calendar that is not the sun's, so its season wanders from one
# year to the next. Scented at night. Tall, pale, and not very hardy.
kind: bulb
wakes: at the 6th full moon asleep
opens: at the full moon
stands: 55
leaves: 3 broad
stem: 36
flower: 5 #e6cf6e
scent: night
multiplies: seed
leaf: waxy
coat: none
hardy: -9
